        "html": "<figure class=\"case-flow-overview case-flow-compact study-workflow-overview\" data-flow-scene=\"d5\" style=\"margin:18px 0 24px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fafbf9;border:1px solid #e0e6e0;border-radius:8px;min-width:0;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><style>.case-flow-compact h3{font-size:19px!important;line-height:1.6!important;color:#355a50;margin:0 0 5px!important}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-scroll{overflow-x:auto;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;overscroll-behavior-x:contain}.case-flow-compact svg{display:block;width:100%;min-width:940px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-title{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;fill:#355a50}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-detail{font-size:14px;fill:#6b8078}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-edge{font-size:13px;fill:#70877d;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fafbf9;stroke-width:4px}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node polygon{stroke:#b7c8bc;stroke-width:1}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[role=button]{cursor:pointer;outline:none}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[aria-current=true] rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[aria-current=true] polygon,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node:focus rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node:focus polygon{stroke:#347a65;stroke-width:2}.case-flow-compact svg text{pointer-events:none}.case-flow-compact figcaption{font-size:14px!important;line-height:1.7!important;color:#75877b;margin:4px 0 0!important}</style><h3>本例方法概览</h3><div class=\"case-flow-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"流程概览，可横向滚动\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1100 250\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"钻井液性能调控：温度变化下寻找可行塑性黏度\"><defs><marker id=\"cf-d5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L6 3L0 6Z\" fill=\"#78958b\"/></marker></defs>\n <path d=\"M210 65H230\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d5)\"/><path d=\"M420 65H440\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d5)\"/><path d=\"M630 65H670\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d5)\"/><path d=\"M800 65H880\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d5)\"/><text x=\"840\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">可继续</text><path d=\"M735 110V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d5)\"/><text x=\"775\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">需核查</text><path d=\"M325 95V170H440\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d5)\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同一观测</text><path d=\"M860 170H870V120H975V95\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#cf-d5)\"/><text x=\"927\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">确认后</text><path d=\"M975 95V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d5)\"/><path d=\"M535 195V222H975V195\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d5)\"/><text x=\"750\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同条件对照</text>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"0\" data-flow-node=\"input\" transform=\"translate(20 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eef2ed\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">流变实验批次</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">固相剂量温度与PV</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"0\" data-flow-node=\"prepare\" transform=\"translate(230 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">分开实验批次</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">140训练与70留出</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(440 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">非线性响应面</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">拟合平方项与交互项</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(440 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f4efe4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">线性经验基线</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">同样实验条件比较</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"2\"><polygon points=\"735,20 800,65 735,110 670,65\" fill=\"#fbf0d9\"/><text x=\"735\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">输入与场景是否对应？差异需要人工复核吗？</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(670 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f6eade\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">筛选可行配方</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">温度和PV上下限</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(880 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">配方候选排序</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">目标偏差和相对成本</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(880 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">批次误差比较</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">留出PV的RMSE</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"0\"><h3>1. 分开实验批次</h3><p><b>输入与动作：</b>140批拟合，70批独立评价。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>先把实验与留出分开（手算教学例，非本次运行成绩）</caption><thead><tr><th>集合</th><th>独立批次数</th><th>用途</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>训练</td><td>140</td><td>拟合响应面</td></tr><tr><td>留出</td><td>70</td><td>同批比较两种预测</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>每批记录固相体积分数%、聚合物浓度g/100mL、温度℃和实测PV；留出不用于拟合。</p><p><b>产物：</b>批次RMSE</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：噪声只改变留出批次。</p></article><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"1\"><h3>2. 建立流变响应面</h3><p><b>输入与动作：</b>拟合固相、剂量、温度及平方/交互项。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>同斜率问题的单位换算（手算教学例，非本次运行成绩）</caption><thead><tr><th>剪切速率 / s⁻¹</th><th>τ (YP=5 Pa, PV=20 mPa·s) / Pa</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>500</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>1000</td><td>25</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>τ=YP+PV·γ̇，代入Pa与s⁻¹时把PV除以1000；这里不预测YP。</p><p><b>产物：</b>多项式系数与经验基线</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：响应面只覆盖本例参数范围。</p></article><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"2\"><h3>3. 搜索可行配方</h3><p><b>输入与动作：</b>扫描剂量和固相网格，筛选PV范围再排序。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>可行性与目标代价分两步（手算教学例，非本次运行成绩）</caption><thead><tr><th>候选PV</th><th>范围15—45 mPa·s</th><th>目标30的偏差</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>12</td><td>排除</td><td>18</td></tr><tr><td>28</td><td>保留</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>50</td><td>排除</td><td>20</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>25个固相×15个聚合物=375候选。先筛范围，再以|PV−目标|+0.4×相对代价排序；代价不是货币报价。</p><p><b>产物：</b>可行数量与候选剂量</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：没有可行点时说明约束冲突。</p></article>"
      }
